---
kind: lore
id: keepsakes
title: What the Hearth gives her to keep
components: [../components/keepsake.component.lute]
---
/* One beat per NPC, all from the `keepsake` template: talk to them once
their bond is high enough and they give Wren something to carry. */

<beat use="keepsake" id="maud" who="maud" item="kettleLid" need="4" instance="use-001">
  @maud{code="0010" emotion="fond"}: Lid off my first kettle. The kettle's long gone. The lid wouldn't go with it.
</beat>

<beat use="keepsake" id="oskar" who="oskar" item="anvilSpark" need="4" instance="use-002">
  @oskar{code="0010" emotion="wry"}: First spark off the warm forge. Caught it in a jar. Don't open it indoors.
</beat>

<beat use="keepsake" id="sable" who="sable" item="cisternGlass" need="3" instance="use-003">
  @sable{code="0010" emotion="guarded"}: Water from the cistern. It remembers being rain. Maybe it'll remind you.
</beat>
